    <div class="sl"><b>seat24c@phone</b>:~$ ping -c1 shed.example.net <span class="sl-d">&rarr; 703 ms</span></div>
    <div class="sl"><b>seat24c@phone</b>:~$ et dmk@shed.example.net:2022</div>
    <div class="sl sl-i">&#9675; connection lost &mdash; handoff</div>
    <div class="sl sl-i">&#9679; reattached, replaying 2.1 kB of buffer</div>
    <div class="sl"><b>seat24c@phone</b>:~$ tmux attach -t atlantic</div>
